## **STEP 0: CONNECT TO DB (RUN FIRST)**

```r
library(DBI)
con <- dbConnect(RSQLite::SQLite(), "data/winweave.db")
```

---

## **VALUE SETS (ALL POSSIBLE VALUES)**

| Table | Column | Command to List All |
|------|--------|---------------------|
| `props` | `player_display_name` | `dbGetQuery(con, "SELECT DISTINCT player_display_name FROM props ORDER BY player_display_name")` |
| `props` | `opponent_team` | `dbGetQuery(con, "SELECT DISTINCT opponent_team FROM props ORDER BY opponent_team")` |
| `props` | `position` | `dbGetQuery(con, "SELECT DISTINCT position FROM props ORDER BY position")` |
| `snap_counts` | `player` | `dbGetQuery(con, "SELECT DISTINCT player FROM snap_counts ORDER BY player")` |
| `snap_counts` | `team` | `dbGetQuery(con, "SELECT DISTINCT team FROM snap_counts ORDER BY team")` |
| `depth_charts` | `player_display_name` | `dbGetQuery(con, "SELECT DISTINCT player_display_name FROM depth_charts ORDER BY player_display_name")` |
| `next_gen_stats` | `player_display_name` | `dbGetQuery(con, "SELECT DISTINCT player_display_name FROM next_gen_stats ORDER BY player_display_name")` |
| `injuries` | `full_name` | `dbGetQuery(con, "SELECT DISTINCT full_name FROM injuries ORDER BY full_name")` |
| `contracts` | `player` | `dbGetQuery(con, "SELECT DISTINCT player FROM contracts ORDER BY player")` |

